syntax:
Declaration syntax with nested types and operator precedence:

// General form
[type specifiers] [declarator]

// Declarator patterns
pointer-declarator: * [declarator]
function-declarator: [declarator] ( [parameter list] )
array-declarator: [declarator] [size]

// Operator precedence (highest to lowest)
// 1. [] (array), () (function call), () (function pointer)
// 2. * (pointer)
// 3. postfix operators
// 4. prefix operators
// 5. type qualifiers

// Example of complex declaration
int *(*fpArray[10])(void); // fpArray is an array of 10 pointers to functions returning pointers to int
